            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Death Flame"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(light)\n\nWhen the caligni defender dies, their body combusts in a flash of white-hot flame. All creatures in a 20-foot burst take 6d10 fire damage (26 basic Reflex save). Their gear and treasure are unaffected by the flames and are left in a pile where they died."
